GMZ600-031000-

401 PM CDT Sat Aug 2 2025



.SYNOPSIS...

A light westerly to southwesterly flow today will become variable

along the coast through the remainder of the weekend as a frontal

boundary slips just south of the coast and stalls. A light

onshore flow will follow through the middle of next week. Seas

will remain generally 2 feet or less.



