...SMALL CRAFT ADVISORY IN EFFECT FROM SUNDAY MORNING THROUGH

LATE SUNDAY NIGHT...



.TONIGHT...NW wind 10 to 20 kt, a few evening gusts to 25 kt. 

Seas 3 to 5 ft. Wave Detail: NW 2 ft at 4 seconds and NW 4 ft at 

7 seconds. 

.SUN...NW wind 5 to 10 kt, becoming W 15 to 20 kt in the

afternoon. Seas 3 to 4 ft. Wave Detail: W 2 ft at 4 seconds, NW

3 ft at 9 seconds and S 2 ft at 15 seconds. A slight chance of

very light drizzle in the morning. 

.SUN NIGHT...NW wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 3 to 5 ft. Wave Detail: W 

3 ft at 4 seconds and NW 4 ft at 8 seconds. 

.MON...NW wind 5 to 10 kt, becoming W 10 to 15 kt in the

afternoon. Seas 3 to 4 ft. Wave Detail: W 2 ft at 4 seconds and

NW 3 ft at 8 seconds. 

.MON NIGHT...W wind 15 to 20 kt, becoming NW 5 to 10 kt after

midnight. Seas 3 to 5 ft. Wave Detail: W 3 ft at 4 seconds and NW

4 ft at 7 seconds. 

.TUE...NW wind 5 to 10 kt. Seas around 3 ft. Wave Detail: NW 3 ft

at 8 seconds. 

.TUE NIGHT...NW wind 5 to 10 kt. Seas 3 to 4 ft. Wave Detail: W

3 ft at 7 seconds. 

.WED...NW wind around 5 kt, backing to W in the afternoon. Seas

around 3 ft. Wave Detail: NW 3 ft at 8 seconds. 

.WED NIGHT...NW wind 5 to 10 kt. Seas 3 to 5 ft. Wave Detail: W

3 ft at 7 seconds and SW 2 ft at 14 seconds. 

.THU...NW wind around 5 kt, backing to W in the afternoon. Seas

3 to 4 ft. Wave Detail: NW 3 ft at 8 seconds. 

.THU NIGHT...NW wind 5 to 10 kt. Seas 3 to 5 ft. 



