FNUS56 KSEW 031451

FWFSEW



Fire Weather Planning Forecast for Western Washington

National Weather Service Seattle WA

751 AM PDT Sun Aug 3 2025



.DISCUSSION...Low level onshore flow pattern into the middle of the

week combined with an upper level trough aloft will give the area 

cooler than normal temperatures. A weather system will arrive 

Wednesday into Thursday, which will give a chance for wetting rains 

to the Olympic Peninsula, as well as the North Cascades. An upper 

ridge will build next weekend for the return of dry, warm weather.



 Forecast for 20 foot wind speed (valleys and ridge tops) are 10

 minute averages reflecting RAWS winds.



