afternoon. Partly sunny. Highs 65 to 75. 

.TONIGHT...Southeast winds around 10 mph. Waves 1 foot or less.

Areas of smoke early in the evening. Slight chance of

thunderstorms in the evening. Chance of showers after midnight.

