the afternoon. Seas 3 to 5 ft. 

.MON NIGHT...SW winds less than 10 kt. Seas 3 to 5 ft. 

.TUE...S winds less than 10 kt. Seas 3 to 5 ft. 

.TUE NIGHT...NE winds less than 10 kt in the evening, becoming

variable winds less than 10 kt. Seas 3 to 5 ft. 

.WED...Variable winds less than 10 kt, becoming W less than

10 kt in the afternoon. Seas 4 to 6 ft. 

