Synopsis for the the SW N Atlantic including the Bahamas



.SYNOPSIS...High pressure will dominate the weather pattern

through the period, supporting gentle to moderate anticyclonic

flow and slight to moderate seas mainly N of 25N. The northern

portion of a tropical wave, currently moving across the

Dominican Republic, will move across the remainder Hispaniola 

this morning, reach the Turks and Caicos Islands today, and the 

SE Bahamas tonight. The pressure gradient between the wave and 

high pressure E of the Bahamas will support moderate to fresh 

trades S of 25N during this period. 



