FZNT27 KNHC 031518

OFFN06



NAVTEX Marine Forecast

NWS National Hurricane Center Miami, FL

1118 AM EDT Sun Aug 3 2025



...Please refer to Coastal Waters Forecasts (CWF) available

through NOAA Weather Radio and other means for detailed

Coastal Waters Forecasts...



.SYNOPSIS...A frontal boundary will remain nearly stationary

across the northern Gulf region through at least Tue, generating

scattered to numerous showers and thunderstorms. Wind and seas

could be higher near thunderstorms. A weak low pressure is

forecast to persist along the front in the vicinity of SE

Louisiana. Elsewhere, a weak ridge will prevail supporting

mostly gentle to moderate winds and slight to moderate seas.

Pulsing fresh E winds are likely at night north and west of the

Yucatan Peninsula, Mon night through Wed night, as a trough

develops there daily and drifts westward.  



Northwest Gulf of America



.THIS AFTERNOON...NW winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less.

Scattered showers and isolated tstms. 

.TONIGHT...NW to N winds 5 to 10 kt, shifting to SE to S late.

Seas 2 ft or less. 

.MON...SW to W winds 5 to 10 kt, shifting to NW in the

afternoon. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.MON NIGHT...SE to S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.TUE...S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.TUE NIGHT...SE to S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.WED...SE to S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.WED NIGHT...SE to S winds 10 to 15 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.THU...S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.THU NIGHT...SE to S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less.  



North Central and Northeast Gulf of America



.THIS AFTERNOON...SW to W winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less.

Scattered showers and isolated tstms. 

.TONIGHT...S to SW winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less.

Scattered showers and isolated tstms. 

.MON...S to SW winds 10 to 15 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. Scattered

showers and isolated tstms. 

.MON NIGHT...S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. Scattered

showers and isolated tstms. 

.TUE...S to SW winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.TUE NIGHT...SE to S winds 5 to 10 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.WED...S winds less than 5 kt,  shifting to N in the afternoon.

Seas 2 ft or less. 

.WED NIGHT...E winds less than 5 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.THU...NW to N winds less than 5 kt. Seas 2 ft or less. 

.THU NIGHT...N winds less than 5 kt, shifting to SE late. Seas

2 ft or less.



