Regional Weather Summary

National Weather Service State College PA

1125 AM EDT Sun Aug 3 2025



High pressure will remain in control with abundant sunshine,

pleasant temperatures, and low humidity. Today will be another 

gorgeous day with plenty of sunshine. Highs will be in the upper 

70s to lower 80s. Lows Sunday night will be in the 50s.



Mainly dry weather will continue across the region for 

much of the upcoming week with temperatures trending up by a

couple degrees each day through Wednesday. 



$$



