IFR CIGs have just rolled into KDHT as of this writing. KAMA may

potentially see conditions degrade to IFR for a short time as

well, at the start of this 12Z period. Have left IFR CIGs out of 

the KAMA TAF at this time due to low confidence. Otherwise 

expecting VFR conditions to prevail. There is a low chance for 

thunderstorms to impact the terminals later in this period. Some 

amendments may be needed if so. 





