NZUS99 KEAX 031534 RRA

WRKZKC



DISCUSSION FOR ST. LOUIS LAMBERT INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT

NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE OLATHE KS

1034 AM CDT Sun Aug 3 2025 



Surface high over Great Lakes holds on through tomorrow. However, 

CAMs hint at increasing moisture and instabilities resulting in a 

chance of PM convection (HRRR most aggressive) across S IL Monday 

afternoon. Bulk of precip should be confined east of KSTL, and 

perhaps worthy of just a mention in the AFD at this time. Otherwise, 

expect VFR conditions and light NE surface winds.



Otto



AIRPORT ARRIVAL RATE: 84

ACTIVE RUNWAY: 12 

DELAYS: NONE



$$



