Crow Wing-Northern Aitkin-South Aitkin-Carlton/South St. Louis-

Pine-Douglas-Bayfield-Ashland-Iron-Burnett-Washburn-Sawyer-Price-

1035 AM CDT Sun Aug 3 2025



This Hazardous Weather Outlook is for portions of northeast

Minnesota and northwest Wisconsin.



.DAY ONE...Today and Tonight



Smoke will persist across the area through today. Please refer to

the latest Air Quality Alerts for more details. 



A few thunderstorms are possible this afternoon from the Brainerd

Lakes northward, however, severe storms are not expected. 



.DAYS TWO THROUGH SEVEN...Monday through Saturday



Smoke continues over portions of the Northland into at least 

Monday. Please refer to the latest Air Quality Alerts for more 

details.



There will be on and off slight chances for isolated

thunderstorms

throughout the week. 



.SPOTTER INFORMATION STATEMENT...



Skywarn spotter activation will not be needed today or tonight.



$$



